 ## 2025-11-12 Invoice numbers
 Decision: invoices are numbered INV-0001, INV-0002, ... in the order they are issued. Why: the accountant asked for a
 gapless series.
+
+## 2026-10-26 One rounding rule for cart and invoice
+Decision: an invoice total follows the cart: each line is rounded to the nearest cent (half up), then the lines are
+added up. Only invoices issued from now on use it: a reprint shows the total stored at issue time, and INV-0001..0003
+keep their totals; the cent of INV-0003 goes through a credit note if the owner wants one.
+Why: the customer pays the cart total; the ticket did not say which rule wins or what happens to issued invoices, and
+docs/invoicing.md never changes an issued invoice.
